#: scripts/cpu_ship_diversification_scenario_utility.lua:223
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "scienceDB"
msgid ""
"The Barracuda started off as a Phobos T3. It was given massive upgrades to "
"shields, hull and missile weapons. The impulse systems were also upgraded. "
"It's designed to spray missiles forth at a prodigious rate.\n"
"\n"
"It barely qualifies as a frigate, it's more like a mini-corvette."
msgstr ""
"Le Barracuda a démarré comme un Phobos T3. Il a reçu des améliorations "
"massives au niveau de ses boucliers, coque et missiles. Les systèmes à "
"impulsion ont également été améliorés. Il est conçu pour lancer des missiles "
"à une vitesse prodigieuse.\n"
"\n"
"On le qualifie à peine de frégate, elle s'apparente plutôt à une mini-"
"corvette."

